1
00:00:09,703 --> 00:00:14,579
Every company has a job that none
of the built-in roles describes.

2
00:00:15,037 --> 00:00:19,542
So name one after the job as
your people already say it.

3
00:00:19,994 --> 00:00:25,427
Tick what it may do, grouped by
the part of the business it touches.

4
00:00:25,893 --> 00:00:30,351
Save it, and it stands beside the
ones that came with the product.

5
00:00:30,805 --> 00:00:34,799
Give it to somebody, and what
they can reach changes at once.

6
00:00:39,591 --> 00:00:45,734
And everybody else who holds it changes
with them, which is the whole reason it is a

7
00:00:45,734 --> 00:00:48,879
role and not a list of
ticks on one person.

8
00:00:49,333 --> 00:00:53,327
Next: everything about
one person, in one place.

